        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Under the agreement, we have an exclusive, worldwide license to make, use, sell or distribute products for treating sleep disordered breathing covered by certain patent rights owned, or that may be owned, by Vanderbilt.",
