        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also hold an exclusive worldwide license from Vanderbilt University, to develop, use, grant sublicense and commercialize products, with a different mechanism of action than the Genio system, in the field of sleep disordered breathing conditions and comorbidities of such conditions.",
